hadiths[200]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1201","[AI-translation] Rabi' bin Sulaiman kehte hain ke main ne Imam Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ko Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki hadees: Jo Quran ko khush-ilhani se na padhe woh hum mein se nahin, ke bare mein farmate suna: (ke is hadees ka matlab yeh hai ke) hamein use ghamgeen awaz aur thehri hui tilawat ke sath padhna chahiye."
"1202","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain: Jo Quran ko khush-ilhani se na padhe woh hum mein se nahin."
"1203","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo bade ki izzat na kare, chhote par rehem na kare, neki ka hukm na de aur burai se mana na kare, woh hum mein se nahin."
"1204","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Kulsum bint Uqbah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, jo Hazrat Abdur Rahman bin Auf (Raziyallahu anhu) ki biwi aur Usman bin Affan ki sauteli behn thin, ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh shakhs jhoota nahin jo do aadmiyon ke darmiyan sulah karae, pas (is maqsad ke liye) woh achchi baat kahe ya achchi baat pahunchaye."
"1205","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Kulsum bint Uqbah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Teen cheezon ke siwa jhoot ki koi rukhsat nahin. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmaya karte thay: Main in (teen) ko jhoota shumar nahin karta: woh shakhs jo logon ke darmiyan sulah karae aur sulah ke liye koi baat (khilaf-e-haqeeqat) kahe, aur woh shakhs jo jang mein koi baat (khilaf-e-haqeeqat) kahe, aur woh shakhs jo apni biwi se koi baat (khilaf-e-haqeeqat) kahe, aur biwi jo apne shohar se koi baat (khilaf-e-haqeeqat) kahe."
"1206","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Kulsum bint Uqbah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh shakhs jhoota nahin jo logon ke darmiyan sulah karae, pas (is maqsad ke liye) woh achchi baat kahe ya achchi baat pahunchaye."
"1207","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maal ki kasrat maal-dari nahin; haqeeqi maal-dari dil ki ghina (qana'at) hai."
"1208","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maal ki kasrat maal-dari nahin; balke haqeeqi maal-dari dil ki ghina (qana'at) hai."
"1209","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae logo! Maal ki kasrat maal-dari nahin; haqeeqi maal-dari dil ki ghina hai. Phir beshak Allah Tabarak wa Ta'ala har bande ko us ka mukammal rizq dega jo us ne us ke liye likha hai, pas rizq ko achche tareeqe se talab karo, jo halal ho woh lo aur jo haram ho woh chhod do."
"1210","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maal ki kasrat maal-dari nahin, balke (haqeeqi) maal-dari dil ki ghina (qana'at) hai. Muslim ne bhi use apni sanad se Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se marfoo'an riwayat kiya hai."
"1211","[AI-translation] Yeh hadees ek doosri sanad se bhi Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se isi tarah marwi hai."
"1212","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo kushti mein doosron ko pichhaad de woh taqatwar aur bahadur nahin; balke taqatwar aur bahadur woh hai jo gusse ke waqt apne nafs par qabu rakhe. (Imam) Malik ne is hadees ko paanch rawiyon ke zariye is tarah riwayat kiya hai: Qa'nabi ne kaha Malik se; Ibn Yusuf ne kaha hamein Malik ne khabar di; Ibn Safir ne kaha mujhe Malik ne bayan kiya; Ibn Bukair ne kaha hamein Malik ne bayan kiya; aur Ibn Wahb ne kaha mujhe Malik ne khabar di. Muslim bin Hajjaj ne bhi use isi tarah Yahya bin Sa'id aur Abdullah bin Hammad se apni sanad ke sath riwayat kiya hai, donon ne kaha: Main ne Malik par padh kar sunaya."
"1213","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek dua se zyada izzat wali koi cheez nahin."
"1214","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek dua se zyada izzat wali koi cheez nahin."
"1215","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Baghawat aur sarkashi ki saza se zyada tez aane wali koi cheez nahin."
"1216","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hazar apne jaisi cheezon mein momin se behtar koi cheez nahin."
"1217","[AI-translation] Mutarrif bin Abdullah apne walid se riwayat karte hain, jinhon ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur main ne Aap ko padhte suna: Kasrat ki hirs ne tumhen ghafil kar diya (Surah Takasur: 1) Ek doosre par sabqat ki khwahish ne tumhen ghafil kar diya. (Phir) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ibn Adam kehta hai: Mera maal, mera maal, halanke tumhare maal mein se sirf woh tumhara hai jo tum ne kha kar khatm kar diya, ya pehen kar purana kar diya, ya sadqa kar ke aage bhej diya."
"1218","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sa'd bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Behtareen zikr chhupa hua zikr hai, aur behtareen rozi woh hai jo kifayat kare."
"1219","[AI-translation] Yeh riwayat Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman se bhi ek doosri sanad ke sath marwi hai."
"1220","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman bin Labeebah kehte hain ke Umar bin Sa'd ne apne walid se kaha: Tum ehl-e-Badr mein se ho aur un mein se ho jinhen Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Shura ke liye muntakhab kiya. Phir unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Behtareen rozi woh hai jo kifayat kare, aur behtareen zikr chhupa hua zikr hai."
"1221","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mareez ki behtareen iyadat woh hai jo sab se chhup kar ki jae. Yeh hadees mukhtasar hai."
"1222","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtareen majlisein woh hain jo kushadah hon."
"1223","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Abi Amrah Ansari kehte hain ke Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) ko un ke qabile mein ek janaze ki khabar di gayi. Woh der se pahunche yahan tak ke log apni jagahon par baith chuke thay. Phir woh aae, aur jab logon ne unhen aate dekha to un ke liye jagah kushadah karne lage. Un mein se ba'z khade ho gae taake woh un ki jagah baith jaen. Phir unhon ne kaha: Suno! Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Behtareen majlisein woh hain jo kushadah hon. Phir woh ek taraf hat gae aur khuli jagah mein baith gae."
"1224","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Shaqiq kehte hain ke Hazrat Mihjan Deeli (Raziyallahu anhu) se kaha gaya: Tum falan ki tarah zyada namaz kyun nahin padhte? Unhon ne jawab diya: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Tumhare deen ka behtareen hissa woh hai jo sab se aasan ho."
"1225","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare deen ka behtareen hissa woh hai jo sab se aasan ho. Tabarani ne kaha: Sirf Salam ne use Qatadah se riwayat kiya hai, aur Ismail ibn Yazid is ki riwayat mein munfarid hain."
"1226","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtareen nikah woh hai jo sab se aasan ho."
"1227","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hakim bin Hizam (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtareen sadqah woh hai jis ke ba'd aadmi mustaghni rahe, aur upar wala hath neeche wale hath se behtar hai, aur (sadqah aur ehsan ki) ibteda un se karo jin ki tum kifalat karte ho."
"1228","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hakim bin Hizam (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Upar wala hath neeche wale hath se behtar hai, aur (sadqah o khairaat ki) ibteda un se karo jin ki tum kifalat karte ho, aur behtareen sadqah woh hai jis ke ba'd aadmi mustaghni rahe. Aur jo bachna chahe Allah use bachaega, aur jo mustaghni hona chahe Allah use mustaghni kar dega."
"1229","[AI-translation] Hazrat Hakim bin Hizam (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Upar wala hath neeche wale hath se behtar hai, aur tum mein se har ek ko (sadqah o khairaat ki) ibteda un se karni chahiye jin ki woh kifalat karta hai, aur behtareen sadqah woh hai jis ke ba'd aadmi mustaghni rahe. Jo bachna chahe Allah use bachaega, aur jo mustaghni hona chahe Allah use mustaghni kar dega."
"1230","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Upar wala hath neeche wale hath se behtar hai."
"1231","[AI-translation] Yeh hadees ek doosri sanad se bhi Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se isi tarah marwi hai."
"1232","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtareen sadqah woh hai jo is halat mein diya jae ke aadmi dene ke ba'd bhi maal-dar rahe, aur upar wala hath neeche wale hath se behtar hai, aur (sadqah ki) ibteda un se karo jin ki tum kifalat karte ho."
"1233","[AI-translation] Hazrat Zaid bin Khalid (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne yeh khutba Tabook mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke munh se suna. Main ne Aap ko ek taweel khutbe mein farmate suna: Behtareen amal woh hai jo nafa pahunchaye, aur behtareen hidayat woh hai jis ki pairwi ki jae, aur dil mein rakhi gayi behtareen cheez yaqeen hai."
"1234","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Logon mein behtareen woh hai jo (doosre) logon ko sab se zyada nafa pahunchaye. Yeh hadees mukhtasar hai."
"1235","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ke nazdeek behtareen sathi woh hai jo apne sathi ke sath sab se achcha ho, aur Allah ke nazdeek behtareen padosi woh hai jo apne padosi ke sath sab se achcha ho."
"1236","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Aktham bin Abil Junoon se farmaya: Ae Aktham! Safar ke behtareen sathi chaar hain, aur behtareen harawal chaar sau hai, aur behtareen lashkar chaar hazar hai."
"1237","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtareen sathi chaar hain, aur behtareen ladne wali jama'at chaar sau hai, aur behtareen lashkar chaar hazar hai, aur barah hazar ka lashkar sirf tadaad ki kami ki wajah se kabhi maghloob nahin ho sakta."
"1238","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Aktham bin Abil Junoon se farmaya: Ae Aktham! Safar ke liye sathiyon ki behtareen tadaad chaar hai, aur behtareen harawal chalis hai, aur behtareen ladne wali jama'at chaar sau hai, aur behtareen lashkar chaar hazar hai. Aur barah hazar ka lashkar sirf tadaad ki kami ki wajah se maghloob nahin ho sakta. Ae Aktham! Agar tum apne qabile ke siwa doosre logon ke sath jihad karo, tumhara akhlaq sanwar jaega aur tum apne sathiyon ki nazar mein ba-izzat ho jaoge."
"1239","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtareen sathi chaar hain, aur behtareen ladne wali jama'at chaar sau hai, aur behtareen lashkar chaar hazar hai, aur barah hazar ka lashkar sirf thodi tadaad ki wajah se kabhi maghloob nahin ho sakta jab tak woh sabr karen aur sach bolen."
"1240","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain. Ek rawi ne kaha: (ke Nabi, Sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya:) Tum mein se behtareen. Aur doosre rawi ne kaha: (ke Nabi, Sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya:) Tum mein se behtareen woh hai jo Quran seekhe aur (doosron ko) sikhaye."
"1241","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se behtareen woh hai jo Quran seekhe aur (doosron ko) sikhaye."
"1242","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se behtareen woh hai jo Quran seekhe aur (doosron ko) sikhaye."
"1243","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se behtareen woh hai jo apne ghar walon ke sath sab se achcha ho."
"1244","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se behtareen woh hai jo apne ghar walon ke sath sab se achcha ho, aur main tum mein se apne ghar walon ke sath sab se achcha hun."
"1245","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Kabshah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se behtareen woh hai jo apne ghar walon ke sath sab se achcha ho."
"1246","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se behtareen woh hai jis se khair ki ummeed ho aur log us ke shar se mehfooz hon, aur tum mein se bad-tareen woh hai jis se khair ki ummeed na ho aur log us ke shar se mehfooz na hon."
"1247","[AI-translation] Yeh hadees Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad se bhi ek doosri sanad ke sath marwi hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhen tumhare achche aur bure logon ke bare mein na bataun? Pas ek aadmi ne kaha: Kyun nahin. Phir Nabi ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"1248","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya main tumhen tumhare achche aur bure logon ke bare mein na bataun? Tumhare achche log woh hain jin ke shar se doosre mehfooz hon aur jin se khair ki ummeed ho, aur tumhare bure log woh hain jin se khair ki ummeed na ho aur jin ke shar se doosre mehfooz na hon."
"1249","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare gharon mein behtareen woh hai jis mein yateem ki izzat ki jae."
"1250","[AI-translation] Suwaid bin Hubairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtareen maal phal-dar khajoor ke darkhton se ghira hua rasta ya zyada bachche dene wali ghodi hai."
"1251","[AI-translation] Suwaid bin Hubairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi ka behtareen maal zyada bachche dene wali bakri ya phal-dar khajooron se ghira hua rasta hai. Mu'jam Ibnul A'rabi mein Muslim bin Nazir se isi tarah marwi hai, aur muhaddiseen ne bhi isi tarah riwayat kiya hai. Lekin Abu Ubaid ki Gharibul Hadis mein, woh Muslim bin Budail se hai. Aur Abu Muhammad ne Suwaid bin Hubairah ka zikr Musnadus Sahabah minas Sahabah mein isi hadees ke sath kiya hai."
"1252","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karti hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Aurton ke liye behtareen masjidein un ke gharon ke andaruni hisse hain."
"1253","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, tumhare kapdon mein behtareen safed hain, pas apne zindon ko un mein libas pehnao aur apne murdon ko un mein kafan do. Aur beshak, tumhare surmon mein behtareen surmah ismid hai, kyunke woh basarat tez karta hai aur palkon ko ugata hai."
"1254","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare surmon mein behtareen surmah ismid hai, jo basarat tez karta hai aur palkon ko ugata hai. Aur tumhare kapdon mein behtareen safed hain, pas apne zindon ko un mein libas pehnao aur apne murdon ko bhi un mein kafan do."
"1255","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare jawano mein behtareen woh hain jo tumhare budhon se mushabahat rakhen, aur tumhare budhon mein bad-tareen woh hain jo tumhare jawano se mushabahat rakhen."
"1256","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mardon mein behtareen safein un ki agli safein hain, aur bad-tareen un ki pichhli safein hain; aur aurton mein behtareen safein un ki pichhli safein hain, aur bad-tareen un ki agli safein hain."
"1257","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"1258","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Namaz mein mardon ki safon mein behtareen safein agli safein hain, aur bad-tareen pichhli safein hain. Aur aurton ki safon mein behtareen safein pichhli safein hain, aur bad-tareen agli safein hain."
"1259","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mardon mein behtareen safein un ki agli safein hain, aur bad-tareen un ki pichhli safein hain; aur aurton mein behtareen safein un ki pichhli safein hain, aur bad-tareen un ki agli safein hain."
"1260","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Upar wala hath neeche wale hath se behtar hai."
"1261","[AI-translation] Hazrat Sauban (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh jo thoda ho lekin kifayat kare, us se behtar hai jo zyada ho lekin ghafil kar de."
"1262","[AI-translation] Yeh riwayat Muhammad bin Auf se bhi un ki sanad ke sath ek doosri sanad se isi tarah marwi hai."
"1263","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umamah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ae logo! Allah Azza wa Jalla ki taraf ruju' karo. Woh jo thoda ho lekin kifayat kare, us se behtar hai jo zyada ho lekin ghafil kar de. Ae logo! Beshak do raste hain: ek khair ka rasta hai aur doosra shar ka rasta hai. Pas jo shar ke raste ko khair ke raste par tarjeeh de, woh yaqeenan halak ho gaya. Ae logo! Aag se bacho, chahe khajoor ke ek tukde ke zariye ho."
"1264","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Duniya ek sarmaya hai, aur us ka behtareen sarmaya nek biwi hai."
"1265","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Duniya ek sarmaya hai, aur duniya ka behtareen sarmaya nek biwi hai. Muslim ne bhi use apni sanad se Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat kiya hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Duniya ek sarmaya hai, aur duniya ka behtareen sarmaya nek biwi hai."
"1266","[AI-translation] Ibn Shaniyyah kehte hain ke main ne Hazrat Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) ko masjid mein akele baithe dekha, oon ke kinare-dar libas mein lipta hua. Unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tanhai bure sathi se behtar hai, aur achcha sathi tanhai se behtar hai. Achchi baat likhwana khamoshi se behtar hai, aur khamoshi buri baat likhwane se behtar hai."
"1267","[AI-translation] Yeh riwayat Bishm bin Jameel se bhi un ki sanad ke sath ek doosri sanad se isi tarah marwi hai."
"1268","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: (Pehli) neki ko mukammal karna (doosri neki ki) ibteda karne se behtar hai."
"1269","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: (Pehli) neki ko mukammal karna (doosri neki ki) ibteda karne se behtar hai."
"1270","[AI-translation] Hasan Basri kehte hain ke hamein yeh baat pahunchi hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sunnat ke mutabiq thoda amal bid'at ke mutabiq zyada a'mal se behtar hai."
"1271","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se behtareen woh hain jo aazmayishon mein mubtala hon aur kasrat se tauba karen."
"1272","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tum mein se behtareen woh hain jo (apne faraiz ki) adaigi mein sab se behtar hon."
"1273","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki aur us mein unhon ne kaha: Beshak, tum mein se behtareen woh hai jo adaigi mein sab se behtar ho."
"1274","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mominon mein behtareen woh hain jo qana'at karte hain, aur un mein bad-tareen woh hain jo lalach karte hain."
"1275","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Mominon mein behtareen woh hain jo qana'at karte hain, aur un mein bad-tareen woh hain jo lalach karte hain."
"1276","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat ke behtareen log us ke ulama hain, aur us ke ulama mein behtareen woh hain jo burd-bar hain. Suno! Beshak, Allah ke haan sakht-dil jahil ke ek gunah ki maghfirat se pehle narm-dil aalim ke chalis gunah maaf kar diye jate hain. Aur beshak, narm-dil aalim Roz-e-Qayamat is halat mein aayega ke us ka noor chamak raha hoga. Woh us (noor) mein chamakte sitare ki tarah chalega. Imam Hakim (Rahimahullah) ne kaha: (Us ki sanad mein) rawi Ibn Muslima Muhammad bin Muslima Madini hain, aur woh Muhammad bin Muslima Qa'nabi nahin hain."
"1277","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat ke behtareen log woh tez-mizaj hain jo jab gussa hon, (jald) use pi jaen."
"1278","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat ke behtareen log woh tez-mizaj hain jo jab gussa hon, (jald) use pi jaen."
"1279","[AI-translation] Hazrat Samurah bin Jundub (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtareen sadqah zaban ka sadqah hai. Poocha gaya: Allah ke Rasul! Zaban ka sadqah kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Sifarish jis ke zariye tum qaidi ko aazad karao, kisi ko qatl hone se bachao, apne bhai ke sath neki aur ehsan karo, aur us se museebat door karo."
"1280","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtareen sadqah aapas ke ta'alluqat ko durust karna hai."
"1281","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, behtareen sadqah logon ke darmiyan ta'alluqat mein sulah karana hai."
"1282","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Kulsum bint Uqbah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Behtareen sadqah woh hai jo us rishtedar ko diya jae jo dushmani aur bughz rakhta ho."
"1283","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtareen ibadat kushadgi ka intezar karna hai. Imam Malik se muttasil sanad ke sath Baqiyyah ke siwa kisi ne use riwayat nahin kiya."
"1284","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat ki afzal-tareen ibadat Quran ki tilawat hai."
"1285","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtareen fazilat apne sathiyon ki izzat karna hai."
"1286","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtareen jihad zalim hukmaran ke samne haq ki baat kehna hai."
"1287","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtareen jihad zalim hukmaran ya zalim rehnuma ke samne haq aur adl ki baat kehna hai."
"1288","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umamah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi ne pehle Jamrah ke paas kaha: Allah ke Rasul! Kaun sa jihad behtareen hai? Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us se munh pher liya, phir Aap ne poocha: Woh sawal karne wala kahan hai? Rawi kehte hain ke us aadmi ne kaha: Allah ke Rasul! Main yahan hun. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtareen jihad us shakhs ka hai jo zalim hukmaran ke samne haq ki baat kahe."
"1289","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Mu'az apne walid se, woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Behtareen amal yeh hai ke tum us se talluq jodo jo tum se talluq tode, us ko do jo tumhen mehroom kare, aur us ko maaf karo jo tum par zulm kare."
"1290","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) aur Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtareen ibadat deen ki samajh hai, aur deen par fazilat haya hai."
"1291","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki: Iman mein sab se kamil momin woh hai jo akhlaq mein sab se behtar ho."
"1292","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ilm ki fazilat ibadat se badi hai."
"1293","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Bhooke ko khilane se behtar koi amal nahin."
"1294","[AI-translation] Zamrah bin Habib bin Suhaib kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Banda jis cheez ke zariye Allah ka sab se zyada qurb hasil karta hai, woh chhupa hua sajda hai."
"1295","[AI-translation] Ayyub bin Musa apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi baap ne apni aulad ko achche akhlaq se behtar koi tohfa nahin diya."
"1296","[AI-translation] Ayyub bin Musa apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi baap ne apni aulad ko achche akhlaq se behtar koi tohfa nahin diya."
"1297","[AI-translation] Ayyub bin Musa Qurashi apne walid se, woh apne dada se riwayat karte hain, ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kisi baap ne apni aulad ko achche akhlaq se behtar koi tohfa nahin diya."
"1298","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Hazrat Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) Hazrat Mu'az (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas se guzre jab woh ro rahe thay, pas unhon ne kaha: Mu'az! Tum kyun ro rahe ho? Unhon ne jawab diya: Us hadees ki wajah se jo main ne is qabr wale, yani Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se suni, ke: Beshak, thodi si riya-kari bhi shirk hai, aur gumnaam muttaqi log Allah ke mehboob bande hain. Jab woh majlis se ghair-hazir hon, unhen talash nahin kiya jata, aur jab hazir hon, unhen pehchana nahin jata. Yeh log hidayat ke rehnuma aur ilm ke chiraagh hain."
"1299","[AI-translation] Hazrat Usman (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala us bande se mohabbat farmata hai jo khareedne, bechne, ada karne aur talab karne mein narmi ikhtiyar kare."
"1300","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah us bande par rehem farmaye jo dene mein narmi ikhtiyar kare aur talab karne mein bhi narmi barqarar rakhe. Tabarani ne kaha: Abu Ghassan ke siwa kisi ne use Muhammad bin Munkadir se riwayat nahin kiya."
"1301","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala ke nazdeek sab se mehboob jaghein masjidein hain."
"1302","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Allah Ta'ala ke nazdeek sab se mehboob a'mal woh hain jo pabandi se kiye jaen, chahe woh thode hon."
"1303","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) kehti hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Allah ke nazdeek sab se mehboob a'mal woh hain jo pabandi se kiye jaen, chahe woh thode hon."
"1304","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Un a'mal ko lazim pakdo jin ki tum taqat rakhte ho, kyunke Allah Azza wa Jalla nahin thakta, lekin tum thak jate ho. Aur beshak, Allah ke nazdeek sab se mehboob a'mal woh hain jo pabandi se kiye jaen, chahe woh thode hon."
"1305","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Roz-e-Qayamat Allah ke nazdeek logon mein sab se mehboob aur majlis mein us se sab se qareeb adil hukmaran hoga."
"1306","[AI-translation] Ahmad bin Ibrahim Mosuli kehte hain ke hum Shamasiyah mein Khalifa Mamun ke paas thay. Us ke ek taraf Yahya bin Aktham thay. Khalifa ne logon ki taraf dekha aur Yahya se kaha: Kya tum nahin dekhte, Yusuf bin Atiyyah ne mujhe Sabit se bayan kiya, jinhon ne Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) se bayan kiya, ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Saari makhlooq Allah ke zere-kifalat hai; un mein us ke nazdeek sab se mehboob woh hai jo us ke zere-kifalat logon ko sab se zyada nafa pahunchaye."
"1307","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aurat ki namazon mein Allah ke nazdeek sab se mehboob namaz woh hai jo woh apne ghar ke sab se tareek hisse mein padhe."
"1308","[AI-translation] Hasan kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Gusse ke us ghoont se zyada mehboob koi ghoont Allah ke nazdeek nahin jo banda (Allah ki raza ke liye) pi jae, ya museebat ke waqt sabr ka ghoont. Aur Allah ke nazdeek us aansu se zyada mehboob koi qatra nahin jo Allah ke khauf se gire, ya khoon ke us qatre se jo Allah ki rah mein bahaya jae."
"1309","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Roz-e-Qayamat Quran apne sathi (padhne wale) ke liye behtareen sifarishi hoga."
"1310","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umamah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Quran padho, kyunke woh Roz-e-Qayamat apne sathi ke liye behtareen sifarishi hoga."
"1311","[AI-translation] Zaid bin Aslam Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke: Hikmat ki baaton mein se ek baat kehna kitna umdah tohfa hai, jise Musalman sune, phir use apnaye, aur (use amanat samajhte hue) apne Musalman bhai tak pahunchaye."
"1312","[AI-translation] Musa bin Ja'far bin Muhammad bin Ali bin Husain bin Ali bin Abi Talib kehte hain ke mere walid (Ja'far) ne mujhe apne aba-o-ajdad se bayan kiya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Khajoor ke darkht beshak umdah maal hain, kyunke woh kichad mein mazboot rehte hain aur qeht mein ghiza faraham karte hain."
"1313","[AI-translation] Yeh riwayat Hasan bin Abdur Rahman bin Khallad se bhi un ki sanad ke sath ek doosri sanad se isi tarah marwi hai."
"1314","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se khajoor ke darkht ke bare mein poocha gaya, pas Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Woh kichad mein mazboot rehta hai. Mukammal hadees bayan ki gayi."
"1315","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin al-As (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nek aadmi ke liye halal maal kitna umdah hai. Yeh hadees mukhtasar hai."
"1316","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, hikmat ki baat se behtareen tohfa ya behtareen hadiya woh baat hai jise aadmi sune, phir use seekhe aur apne bhai ko sikhaye (yeh cheez) us ke liye ek saal ki ibadat se behtar hai."
"1317","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Munkadir kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Maal Allah Ta'ala ke taqwe ke liye behtareen madadgar hai."
"1318","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain: Bad-shaguni koi cheez nahin, lekin nek-shaguni beshak achchi cheez hai."
"1319","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sirka kitna umdah salan hai."
"1320","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sirka kitna umdah salan hai! Aur aadmi ke liye itna shar kafi hai ke woh jo kuch us ke qareeb laya jae use napasand kare."
"1321","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sirka kitna umdah salan hai, aur aadmi ke liye itna shar kafi hai ke woh jo kuch us ke qareeb laya jae use napasand kare."
"1322","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umamah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Musalman ke liye behtareen ibadat-gah us ka ghar hai."
"1323","[AI-translation] Ismail bin Hasan Bukhari ne khutbe ki sanad ke sath bayan kiya, jo Zaid bin Khalid Juhani (Raziyallahu anhu) se marwi hai, jis ka zikr pehle guzar chuka hai. Unhon ne us khutbe ka zikr kiya, aur us mein yeh bhi tha: Sab se sacchi baat Allah ki Kitab hai, sab se mazboot sahara taqwe ki baat hai, behtareen rasta Nabiyon ka rasta hai, aur sab se izzat wali aur shareef maut shaheed ki maut hai."
"1324","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir Juhani (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath nikle ... aur unhon ne use mukhtasaran zikr kiya."
"1325","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khutba dete hue farmaya karte thay: Do buniyadi cheezein hain: rasta aur baat. Pas sab se sacchi baat Allah ki Kitab hai, aur behtareen rasta Muhammad (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka rasta hai. Bad-tareen umoor (deen mein) nae ijaad-kardah umoor hain, aur har bid'at gumrahi hai. Tum mein koi lambi umr ki khwahish na kare, aur na ummeed tumhen ghafil kare. Har aane wali cheez qareeb hai. Bad-bakht woh hai jo apni maan ke pet mein bad-bakht qaraar diya gaya, aur khush-bakht woh hai jo doosron (ke bure anjam) se ibrat le. Khabardar! Beshak, momin se ladna kufr hai, aur use gali dena fisq hai. Kisi Musalman ke liye jaiz nahin ke woh doosre Musalman se teen din se zyada talluq tode. Bad-tareen riwayatein jhooti riwayatein hain. Jhoot bolna jaiz nahin, na sanjeedgi mein na mazaq mein. Aur aadmi ko apne bete se aisa wada nahin karna chahiye jise woh (ba'd mein) poora na kar sake. Beshak, sach neki ki taraf le jata hai, aur neki Jannat ki taraf le jati hai, aur beshak, jhoot gunah ki taraf le jata hai, aur gunah Jahannam ki taraf le jata hai."
"1326","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Behtareen khushbu mushk hai."
"1327","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Tumhare salanon ka sardar namak hai."
"1328","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sab se jald qabool hone wali dua ghair-hazir ki ghair-hazir ke liye dua hai."
"1329","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Sab se jald qabool hone wali dua ghair-hazir ki ghair-hazir ke liye dua hai."
"1330","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Sab se jald qabool hone wali dua ghair-hazir ki ghair-hazir ke liye dua hai."
"1331","[AI-translation] Hazrat Miqdad bin Aswad (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se yeh sunne ke ba'd main kisi par bharosa nahin karta. Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmaya karte thay: Beshak, Ibn Adam ka dil us degchi se zyada tez badalta hai jab woh shadeed josh mein ubal rahi ho."
"1332","[AI-translation] Hazrat Miqdad bin Amr (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se jo main ne suna us ke ba'd main kisi par bharosa nahin karta. Main ne Aap ko farmate suna ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"1333","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein miswak karne wale kitne umdah hain."
"1334","[AI-translation] Abu Qilabah kehte hain ke Hazrat Abu Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Hazrat Abu Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) se poocha, ya Abu Masud ne Abu Abdullah se poocha: Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko za'amu ke bare mein kya farmate suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko us ke bare mein farmate suna: Za'amu aadmi ke liye bahut buri sawari hai."
"1335","[AI-translation] Abu Qilabah kehte hain ke Abu Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) ne mujh se bayan kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Za'mu aadmi ke liye bahut buri sawari hai. Qazi Abu Abdullah Muhammad bin Salamah bin Ja'far Quda'i ne kaha: Meri rae mein is hadees mein mazkoor Abu Abdullah se murad Huzaifah bin Yaman (Raziyallahu anhu) hain, kyunke woh Abu Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) ke sath Kufah mein rehte thay, woh ek sath baithte aur ek doosre se sawal karte thay. Aur Huzaifah (Raziyallahu anhu) ki kuniyat Abu Abdullah thi."
"1336","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Masud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke un se poocha gaya: Tum ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko za'amu ke bare mein kya farmate suna hai? Unhon ne kaha: Woh aadmi ke liye bahut buri sawari hai."
"1337","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Tabook ki muhim mein nikle, phir unhon ne ek taweel hadees bayan ki jis mein unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke ek taweel khutbe ka zikr kiya, jis mein kaha gaya tha: Bad-tareen umoor (deen mein) nae ijaad-kardah umoor hain, aur bad-tareen andha woh hai jo dil ka andha ho. Bad-tareen uzr woh hai jo maut ke waqt pesh kiya jae, aur bad-tareen sharmindagi Roz-e-Qayamat ki sharmindagi hai. Bad-tareen khana yateem ka maal khana hai, aur bad-tareen kamayi zina ki kamayi hai."
"1338","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aadmi mein bad-tareen cheez cheekhti hui bakheeli ya dil nikal dene wali buzdili hai."
"1339","[AI-translation] Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath nikle ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees aur (tumhara) khutba zikr kiya, aur us mein yeh bhi tha: Hidayat ke ba'd gumrahi sab se badi andhapan hai, aur jhooti zaban sab se badi khata hai."
"1340","[AI-translation] Hazrat Miqdam bin Ma'dikarib (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Ibn Adam ne apne pet se zyada bura koi bartan nahin bhara. Ibn Adam ke liye chand luqme kafi hain jo us ki peeth seedhi rakhen, aur agar use zyada khana hi ho to (us ke pet ka) ek tihai khane ke liye, ek tihai peene ke liye, aur ek tihai saans ke liye hona chahiye."
"1341","[AI-translation] Hazrat Miqdam bin Ma'dikarib (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"1342","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mere ehl-e-bait ki misaal Nuh ki kashti jaisi hai; jo us mein sawar hua nijat pa gaya, aur jo peechhe reh gaya gharq ho gaya."
"1343","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mere ehl-e-bait ki misaal Nuh ki kashti jaisi hai; jo us mein sawar hua nijat pa gaya, aur jo peechhe reh gaya gharq ho gaya. Aur jo aakhri zamane mein hum se ladega, goya woh Dajjal ke sath mil kar (hum se) lada."
"1344","[AI-translation] Yeh riwayat Muslim bin Ibrahim se bhi un ki sanad ke sath ek doosri sanad se isi tarah marwi hai."
"1345","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mere ehl-e-bait ki misaal Nuh ki kashti jaisi hai; jo us mein sawar hua nijat pa gaya, aur jo peechhe reh gaya gharq ho gaya."
"1346","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mere sahaba ki misaal sitaron jaisi hai; jo un ke kisi amal ki pairwi karega hidayat paega."
"1347","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, meri ummat mein mere sahaba ki misaal khane mein namak jaisi hai; khana sirf namak se lazeez hota hai."
"1348","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat mein mere sahaba ki misaal khane mein namak jaisi hai; beshak, khana sirf namak se lazeez hota hai."
"1349","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Meri ummat ki misaal barish jaisi hai; maloom nahin ke khair us ke shuru mein hai ya us ke aakhir mein."
"1350","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"1351","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"1352","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri ummat ki misaal barish jaisi hai; maloom nahin ke khair us ke shuru mein hai ya us ke aakhir mein."
"1353","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Razin Uqaili (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ki misaal shehed ki makkhi jaisi hai, jo sirf woh khati hai jo paak ho aur sirf woh paida karti hai jo paak ho."
"1354","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zarrin Uqaili (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ki misaal shehed ki makkhi jaisi hai, jo sirf woh khati hai jo paak ho aur sirf woh paida karti hai jo paak ho."
"1355","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Momin aur us ke iman ki misaal apne khunte se bandhe hue ghode jaisi hai, jo uchhalta aur koodta hai lekin phir apne khunte ki taraf laut aata hai."
"1356","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin aur us ke iman ki misaal apne khunte se bandhe hue ghode jaisi hai, jo uchhalta aur koodta (door jata) hai lekin phir apne khunte ki taraf laut aata hai. Beshak, momin bhi uchhalta aur koodta (yani bhoolta) hai, lekin phir iman ki taraf laut aata hai."
"1357","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Taqatwar momin ki misaal khajoor ke darkht jaisi hai, aur kamzor momin ki misaal nae paude jaisi hai."
"1358","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Taqatwar momin ki misaal khajoor ke darkht jaisi hai, aur kamzor momin ki misaal khet mein nae paude jaisi hai."
"1359","[AI-translation] Mujahid kehte hain ke main Makkah aur Madinah ke darmiyan (raste mein) Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ke sath raha, aur unhon ne mujhe Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is ek hadees ke siwa koi hadees bayan nahin ki, aur us mein tha: Momin ki misaal. Yeh hadees Hasan bin Abdur Rahman bin Khallad Ramahurmuzi ki kitab Kitabul Amsal mein Abdullah bin Ahmad bin Musa se Sulaiman bin Ayyub ki sanad se marwi hai, aur us mein hai: (Taqatwar momin ki misaal) khajoor jaisi hai, aur (kamzor momin ki misaal) kheti ke nae paude jaisi hai."
"1360","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Momin ki misaal (anaaj ke) teele jaisi hai jise hawa hilati hai; kabhi woh seedha khada hota hai aur kabhi gir jata hai. Aur kafir ki misaal sanobar ke darkht jaisi hai jo hamesha seedha khada rehta hai yahan tak ke ek hi martaba ukhaad diya jata hai."
"1361","[AI-translation] Ek doosri sanad se marwi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ki misaal kheti ke nae paude jaisi hai, jise hawa hilati hai; kabhi woh use seedha khada karti hai aur kabhi use jhuka deti hai. Aur unhon ne baqi hadees bhi bayan ki."
"1362","[AI-translation] Ek aur sanad se marwi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ki misaal teele jaisi hai, jise hawa hilati hai; kabhi woh gir jata hai aur kabhi seedha khada hota hai. Aur kafir ki misaal sanobar ke darkht jaisi hai; beshak, sanobar hamesha seedha khada rehta hai yahan tak ke (ek hi martaba) ukhaad diya jata hai."
"1363","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ki misaal anaaj ke teele jaisi hai jise hawa hilati hai; kabhi woh jhuk jata hai aur kabhi seedha khada hota hai. Aur kafir ki misaal sanobar ya deodar ke darkht (sakht qism ka darkht jis se lakdiyan aur is jaisi cheezein banayi jati hain) jaisi hai jo hamesha seedha khada rehta hai yahan tak ke (achanak, ek hi martaba) ukhaad diya jata hai."
"1364","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ka'b bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ki misaal kheti ke narm paude jaisi hai jise hawayen idhar udhar jhukati rehti hain, aur munafiq ki misaal sanobar ke darkht jaisi hai jo zameen par seedha khada rehta hai yahan tak ke ek hi martaba ukhaad diya jata hai. Abu Amr ne kaha: Urza ra par fatha ke sath hai aur woh urzun se hai. Abu Ubaid ne kaha: Urza ka talafuz fa'ilah jaisa hai. Abu Ubaid ne yeh bhi kaha ke urza ra ke sukoon ke sath hai aur woh sanobar ka darkht hai. Almajdiyah ka ma'na hai: seedha. Inji'af ka ma'na hai: ukhaad diya jana. Aur yeh bhi kaha gaya hai ke inji'af ka lafz jeem ki jagah kha ke sath inkhi'af hai."
"1365","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubayy bin Ka'b (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ki misaal kheti ke nae paude jaisi hai jise hawayen idhar udhar modti rehti hain; kabhi woh jhuka diya jata hai aur kabhi seedha kar diya jata hai. Aur kafir ki misaal sanobar ke darkht jaisi hai jo seedha khada rehta hai, us ki jad (zameen se) alag nahin hoti yahan tak ke ek hi martaba ukhaad diya jata hai."
"1366","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Apni bahami mohabbat, rehem aur shafqat mein mominon ki misaal ek jism jaisi hai; jab us ka koi hissa takleef mein mubtala hota hai, to poora jism bedar rehta hai aur bukhar mein mubtala hota hai."
"1367","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, apni bahami mohabbat, rehem aur shafqat mein mominon ki misaal ek jism jaisi hai; jab us ka koi hissa takleef uthata hai, to poora jism be-khwabi aur bukhar ke sath jawab deta hai."
"1368","[AI-translation] Hazrat Nu'man bin Bashir (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Yaqeenan, bahami talluqat qayam rakhne, aapas mein rehem aur narmi dikhane, aur us mein jo Allah ne un ke darmiyan muqarrar farmaya hai, Musalmanon ki misaal ek jism jaisi hai; jab us ka koi hissa dard mein mubtala hota hai, to poora jism bechain ho jata hai aur be-khwabi aur bukhar mein mubtala hota hai."
"1369","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Dil ki misaal zameen par pade hue par jaisi hai, jise hawayen ulat-pulat karti rehti hain."
"1370","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Quran ki misaal us oont jaisi hai jis ki taang bandhi hui ho; agar us ka malik use bandha rakhe, woh use qabu mein rakhega, aur agar use chhod de, woh bhag jaega."
"1371","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Munafiq ki misaal do rewadon ke darmiyan hairan-sar-gardan ghoomti bakri jaisi hai."
"1372","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Munafiq ki misaal do rewadon ke darmiyan hairan-sar-gardan ghoomti bakri jaisi hai, woh nahin janti ke donon mein se kis ki pairwi kare."
"1373","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) ne use marfoo'an bayan kiya: Munafiq ki misaal do rewadon ke darmiyan hairan-sar-gardan ghoomti bakri jaisi hai."
"1374","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Munafiq ki misaal do rewadon ke darmiyan ghoomti bakri jaisi hai, kabhi ek rewad ki taraf daudti (nar ke liye jima' ki talash mein) aur kabhi doosre rewad ki taraf; woh nahin janti ke donon mein se use kis ki pairwi karni chahiye."
"1375","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Zarr (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Aurat ki misaal tedhi pasli jaisi hai; agar tum use seedha karne ki koshish karo, tum use tod doge, aur agar us se faida uthao, to us se faida uthao jab woh is tedhepan mein ho."
"1376","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Aurat tedhi pasli jaisi hai; agar tum use seedha karne ki koshish karo, tum use tod doge, aur agar us se faida uthao, tum us se faida uthaoge jab woh tedhi ho."
"1377","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se marfoo'an riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Achche sathi ki misaal itar-farosh jaisi hai; chahe woh tumhen itar ka tohfa na de, us ki khushbu zaroor tum tak pahunchegi. Aur bure sathi ki misaal us lohar jaisi hai jo dhoonkni phoonkta hai; chahe woh tumhen apni aag ke sholon'se na jalaye, us ki badbu-dar hawa zaroor tum tak pahunchegi. Yeh hadees Ahmad bin Amr bin Abdul Khaliq Bazzar ne Musnad Abi Musa mein Khallad bin Aslam Marwazi se Nadr bin Shumail se Auf se Qasamah bin Zuhair se Abu Musa Ash'ari (Raziyallahu anhu) ki sanad se bhi bayan ki hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Achche sathi ki misaal itar-farosh jaisi hai; woh ya to tumhen kuch itar tohfe mein dega, ya tum us ke kapdon se khushbu paoge. Aur bure sathi ki misaal lohar jaisi hai; chahe woh tumhare kapde na jalaye, woh zaroor tumhen badbu dega, ya us ka dhuan tumhen takleef deta rahega. Abu Bakr Ahmad bin Amr ne kaha: Aur yeh hadees Hazrat Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) se mauqoofan bhi marwi hai, aur Nadr bin Shumail ke siwa hum kisi ko nahin jante jis ne use marfoo'an bayan kiya ho. Yeh (Abu Bakr Ahmad bin Amr) Bazzar ki ghalati hai, kyunke Yahya bin Ma'in ne use Sufyan bin Uyainah se Buraid bin Abi Burdah se Abi Burdah se Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) ki sanad se marfoo'an bayan kiya hai. Aur Yahya bin Ma'in Bazzar se bade aalim hain, jabke Sufyan bin Uyainah hadees mein Imam hain."
"1378","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Achche sathi ki misaal itar-farosh jaisi hai, aur bure sathi ki misaal us lohar jaisi hai jo dhoonkni phoonkta hai. Chahe woh tumhen na jalaye, us ke shole tum tak pahunchte rahenge."
"1379","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Achche sathi ki misaal itar-farosh jaisi hai, aur bure sathi ki misaal us lohar jaisi hai jo dhoonkni phoonkta hai. Chahe woh tumhen na jalaye, us ke shole tum tak pahunchte rahenge. Imam Bukhari (Rahimahullah) ne bhi yeh hadees Hazrat Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) se marfoo'an bayan ki hai."
"1380","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Musa (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap ne farmaya: Achche sathi aur bure sathi ki misaal mushk uthane wale aur lohar ki dhoonkni phoonkne wale jaisi hai. Pas mushk uthane wala ya to tumhen (kuch mushk) tohfe mein dega, ya tum us se khareedoge, ya tum us se umdah khushbu paoge. Aur lohar ki dhoonkni phoonkne wala ya to tumhare kapde jala dega, ya tum us se badbu paoge."
"1381","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, Quran padhne wale momin ki misaal turanj jaisi hai, jis ki khushbu umdah aur jis ka zaika achcha hai. Aur Quran na padhne wale momin ki misaal khajoor jaisi hai, jis ka zaika achcha hai lekin us mein koi khushbu nahin. Aur Quran padhne wale gunahgar ki misaal niaz-bo jaisi hai, jis ki khushbu umdah lekin jis ka zaika kadwa hai. Aur Quran na padhne wale gunahgar ki misaal indraayan jaisi hai, jis ka zaika kadwa hai aur us mein koi khushbu nahin. Aur achche sathi ki misaal mushk bechne wale jaisi hai; chahe tumhen us se kuch na mile, us ki khushbu zaroor tum tak pahunchegi. Aur bure sathi ki misaal lohar ki bhatti jaisi hai; chahe us ki garmi tum par asar na kare, us ka dhuan zaroor tum tak pahunchega."
"1382","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Achche sathi ki misaal itar-farosh jaisi hai; chahe tumhen us ke itar mein se kuch na mile, tum zaroor us ki khushbu mehsoos karoge. Aur bure sathi ki misaal lohar jaisi hai; chahe us ke shole tumhen na jalayen, us ka dhuan zaroor tumhen takleef dega."
"1383","[AI-translation] Hasan kehte hain ke beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Farz namaz ki misaal tarazu jaisi hai; jo use mukammal rakhega use mukammal ajar milega."
"1384","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Meri aur is duniya ki misaal bilkul us sawar jaisi hai jo dopahar mein shadeed garmi wale din darkht ke sae tale thodi der aaram ke liye thehra, phir use chhod kar aage badh gaya."
"1385","[AI-translation] Bani Qahr ke bhai, Hazrat Mustawrid (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aakhirat ke muqable mein is duniya ki misaal aisi hai jaise tum mein se koi apni shahadat ki ungli samandar mein duboe, phir (use nikal kar) dekhe ke woh kitna pani sath lati hai."
"1386","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mustawrid Qahari (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aakhirat ke muqable mein is duniya ki misaal aisi hai jaise tum mein se koi apni shahadat ki ungli samandar mein duboe, phir (use nikal kar) dekhe ke woh kitna pani sath lati hai. Muslim ibn Hajjaj ne use (muhaddiseen ki) ek jama'at se bayan kiya, jin mein Muhammad ibn Hatim hain, aur yeh un ke alfaz hain. Unhon ne kaha: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne hamein bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Ismail ibn Abi Khalid ne hamein apni sanad ke sath is tarah bayan kiya aur kaha: Jaise tum mein se koi yeh ungli duboe, aur Yahya ibn Sa'id ne apni shahadat ki ungli se ishara kiya."
"1387","[AI-translation] Hazrat Mistawrid Fahri (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Aakhirat ke muqable mein duniya aisi hai jaise tum mein se koi apni ungli samandar mein duboe, phir (use nikal kar) dekhe ke woh kitna pani sath lati hai."
"1388","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Umamah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi bande ke sath khair ka irada farmata hai, woh use shehed banata hai. Sahaba ne poocha: Allah ke Rasul! Use shehed banane se kya murad hai? Aap ne jawab diya: Woh use nek amal ki taufeeq deta hai, phir us ki rooh qabz farmata hai jab woh us (nek amal) par ho."
"1389","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Anbasah Khaulani (Raziyallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak, jab Allah kisi bande ke sath khair ka irada farmata hai, woh use shehed banata hai. Sahaba ne poocha: Allah ke Rasul! Use shehed banane se kya murad hai? Aap ne jawab diya: Woh us ke liye nek a'mal ka darwaza khol deta hai. Phir us ki rooh qabz farmata hai jab woh us (nek amal) par ho."
"1390","[AI-translation] Hazrat Amr bin Humaq (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi bande ke sath khair ka irada farmata hai, woh use (kaam par) lagata hai. Poocha gaya: Allah ke Rasul! Woh use kaise lagata hai? Aap ne farmaya: Woh use maut se pehle nek amal ki taufeeq deta hai."
"1391","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah Ta'ala zameen ke kisi hisse mein kisi bande ki rooh qabz karne ka irada farmata hai, woh us ke liye wahan koi hajat paida kar deta hai."
"1392","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Azzah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne yeh baat farmayi ... (Hadees ke rawi) Ayyub ne kaha: ya unhon ne (wahan ki jagah) kaha koi hajat nahin."
"1393","[AI-translation] Abu Mulaikh apni qaum ke ek aadmi se riwayat karte hain, jis ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jab Allah zameen ke kisi hisse mein kisi bande ki rooh qabz karna chahta hai, woh us ke liye wahan koi hajat paida kar deta hai."
"1394","[AI-translation] Abu Mulaikh apni qaum se riwayat karte hain, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: Jab Allah Ta'ala kahin se kisi ki rooh qabz karna chahta hai, woh us ke liye wahan koi hajat paida kar deta hai."
"1395","[AI-translation] Hazrat Matar bin Ukamis (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah Ta'ala zameen ke kisi hisse mein kisi bande ki rooh qabz karna chahta hai, woh us ke liye wahan koi hajat paida kar deta hai."
"1396","[AI-translation] Hazrat Rafi' bin Khadij (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab Allah kisi se mohabbat farmata hai, woh use duniya se is tarah bachata hai jaise tum mein se koi apne beemar ko pani se bachata hai."
"1397","[AI-translation] Hazrat Qatadah bin Nu'man (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya ... aur unhon ne yeh hadees bayan ki."
"1398","[AI-translation] Hazrat Atiyyah Sa'di (Raziyallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab hukmaran ghusse mein aata hai, shaitan us par ghalbah pa leta hai."
"1399","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab ghulam apne malik ke sath mukhlis ho aur apne Rab ki achche tareeqe se ibadat kare, to us ke liye dohra ajar hai."
"1400","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat karte hain ke Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab ghulam apne malik ke sath mukhlis ho aur apne Rab ki achche tareeqe se ibadat kare, to us ke liye dohra ajar hai."
